---
import Docs from "../../../layouts/Docs.astro";
---
<Docs title="CLI — Botpasses" crumbs={[{ href: "/docs", label: "Docs" }, { href: "/docs/reference/cli", label: "CLI" }]}>
  <h1>CLI</h1>
  <p>
    Use <code>npx vault</code> from this repository (or <code>npm run botpasses</code>).
    Process env names stay <code>VAULT_*</code>. Listen port is <strong>8788</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>Local vault</h2>
  <pre><code>export VAULT_HOME="$PWD/.botpasses"
npx vault init
printf '%s' 'sk_test_example_not_real' | npx vault set STRIPE_KEY
npx vault list
npx vault grant --secret STRIPE_KEY --agent invoicer --tool stripe --once
npx vault run --with STRIPE_KEY --agent invoicer --tool stripe -- \
  node -e 'console.log(Boolean(process.env.STRIPE_KEY))'
npx vault audit
npx vault revoke --secret STRIPE_KEY --agent invoicer --tool stripe</code></pre>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Command</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>vault init</code></td><td>Create <code>$VAULT_HOME</code> and a master key if needed</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>vault set NAME</code></td><td>Encrypt and store. Prints name and last-4. Never the value</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>vault list</code></td><td>Names and last-4</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>vault grant</code></td><td>Approve a pending grant (<code>--once</code> or <code>--session</code>)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>vault revoke</code></td><td>Stop later injects</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>vault audit</code></td><td>Events. No values</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>vault run</code></td><td>Inject into a child process env</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>vault serve</code></td><td>Loopback console, HTTP, and <code>/mcp</code> on 8788</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>vault mcp</code></td><td>Local stdio MCP</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p><code>list</code>, <code>grant</code>, and <code>audit</code> never print a secret value.</p>

  <h2>Hosted login and MCP stdio</h2>
  <p>
    <code>vault login</code> prints <code>/sign-in</code>, <code>/console</code>, and
    <code>/device</code> on the hosted origin. Device login is RFC 8628 after TOTP.
  </p>
  <pre><code>export VAULT_PUBLIC_URL=https://staging.botpasses.com
npx vault login
export VAULT_USER_JWT=eyJ...
npx vault mcp --user-jwt</code></pre>
  <p>
    <code>VAULT_PUBLIC_URL</code> must be a botpasses.com origin or loopback.
    See <a href="/docs/reference/mcp-tools">MCP tools</a> and
    <a href="/docs/reference/http-api">HTTP API</a>.
  </p>
</Docs>
